{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51516","headline":"又过杨相宅 · 汪遵","name":"又过杨相宅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"倚伏从来事不遥，无何平地起青霄。\n才到青霄却平地，门对古槐空寂寥。\n（以上《诗话总龟》二四《感事门》引《唐贤抒情》）（〖1〗《万首唐人绝句》卷六九以此诗爲尹璞作，文字稍异。\n《全唐诗》卷五一七收尹璞名下，幷注出《抒情录》作江遵诗之异文。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"汪遵","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51516.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51516","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}